<title>USA: Viad names new chairman, CEO.</title>
<headline>Viad names new chairman, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viad Corp said Thursday it has appointed President and Chief Operating Officer Robert Bohannon chairman, president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Bohannon's appointment is effective January 1. He succeeds Chairman and Chief Executive John Teets, who is retiring at the end of the year, the company said.</p>
